---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Takedown Requests
description: Request content removal or report infringement
pagefindBody: false
---

<h1 data-i18n="takedown.title">Takedown Requests</h1>

<p
  data-i18n-template="takedown.intro"
  data-i18n-vars='{{ { site: site.brand or site.name } | jsonLd | safe }}'
>
  {{ site.brand or site.name }} links to third-party sources and may display limited metadata (title
  and short summary). If you believe any content on this site should be removed, please contact us
  with the information below.
</p>

<h2 data-i18n="takedown.include.title">What to include</h2>
<ul>
  <li data-i18n="takedown.include.url">The URL(s) on our site you want removed</li>
  <li data-i18n="takedown.include.source">The original source URL(s)</li>
  <li data-i18n="takedown.include.identity">Your name and role (e.g. rights holder, authorized agent)</li>
  <li data-i18n="takedown.include.explanation">A brief explanation of the issue</li>
  <li data-i18n="takedown.include.proof">Any supporting documentation (if applicable)</li>
</ul>

{% if site.contactEmail %}
  <p>
    <strong data-i18n="contact.emailLabel">Email:</strong>
    <a href="mailto:{{ site.contactEmail }}">{{ site.contactEmail }}</a>
  </p>
{% else %}
  <p class="muted">
    <span data-i18n="takedown.noEmail">Contact email is not configured yet. See:</span>
    <a href="{{ '/contact/' | url }}" data-i18n="nav.contact">Contact</a>
  </p>
{% endif %}
